WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:02.618
Being busy is not the same as producing a

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:07.671
useful result In the previous activity you identified what

00:00:07.697 --> 00:00:10.921
is known and what remains unconfirmed in Daniel’s Monday

00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:14.921
requests You will now use that information to prepare

00:00:14.921 --> 00:00:18.737
an executive support brief the working document labelled T1

00:00:18.803 --> 00:00:24.118
. 1 Lindiwe’s decision meeting runs from 10:00 to 10:45 and

00:00:24.211 --> 00:00:29.013
concerns a service investment Finance and operations supply the

00:00:29.079 --> 00:00:33.882
papers Daniel coordinates the pack and preparation In this

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:37.474
activity you will identify what the pack must contain

00:00:37.855 --> 00:00:40.671
who supplies each input and what evidence shows that

00:00:40.724 --> 00:00:44.053
it is ready You can complete your own T1

00:00:44.132 --> 00:00:46.132
. 1 draft beside the lesson
